{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>神舟二十四號太空船將於周三（25日）早上8時18分發射，太空人由湯洪波、武毅，及來自巴基斯坦的穆罕默德‧齊尚‧阿里組成，湯洪波擔任指令長。三名航天員分別為航天駕駛員、航天飛行工程師和載荷專家。（央視／新華社）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T02:23:55.500402+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T01:21:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:27.301217+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:17:28.226951+00:00","content_hash":"b33a358578c3eb63210e954e8274e45910aa697a51109593000d4e917c867200","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}